---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import CalendlyWidget from "../components/sections/CalendlyWidget.astro";
---

<Layout title="Launch Your U.S. TikTok Shop" description="LaunchLegit helps international brands and creators launch TikTok Shop USA with LLC, EIN, U.S. representative, banking support, and approval guidance.">
<section class="hero">
 <div class="container hero-grid">
  <div class="hero-copy reveal">
   <span class="eyebrow">TikTok Shop USA · Cross-border setup</span>
   <h1>Launch Your U.S. TikTok Shop — We Handle Everything for You.</h1>
   <p class="lead">Want to sell on TikTok Shop USA but don't have U.S. documents? We set everything up for international sellers — from LLCs to U.S. representatives — so you can focus on selling while we handle the backend.</p>
   <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#calendly-section">Book a call ↗</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#services">See how it works</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual reveal" aria-label="LaunchLegit U.S. TikTok Shop setup">
   <img src="/images/image1.webp" width="2350" height="2359" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" alt="LaunchLegit U.S. TikTok Shop setup" class="hero-image">
  </div>
 </div>
</section>
<section id="services">
 <div class="container">
  <div class="section-head reveal"><div><span class="section-kicker">What we offer</span><h2>Your Gateway to TikTok Shop USA</h2><p class="lead">A single operating layer for the U.S. requirements international sellers face before they can focus on growth.</p></div><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/services">View all services</a></div>
  <div class="grid-3">
   <article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M8 7h2M14 7h2M8 11h2M14 11h2M8 15h2M14 15h2M10 21v-3h4v3"/></svg></div><h3>TikTok Shop USA Setup</h3><p class="muted">We handle everything — LLC, EIN, U.S. rep, banking — so you can legally sell on TikTok Shop USA, even as a non-resident.</p><a class="card-link" href="/services">Learn about setup →</a></article>
   <article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 8a4 4 0 100 8 4 4 0 000-8z"/><path d="M4.9 4.9l2.2 2.2M16.9 16.9l2.2 2.2M4 12H1M23 12h-3M12 4V1M12 23v-3M4.9 19.1l2.2-2.2M16.9 7.1l2.2-2.2"/></svg></div><h3>Creator Onboarding & Monetization</h3><p class="muted">If you're a content creator, we help you open your own TikTok Shop USA to start earning from affiliate commissions or product sales.</p><a class="card-link" href="/services">Explore creator support →</a></article>
   <article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 7.7-7 10-4-2.3-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>U.S. Business Registration</h3><p class="muted">We'll register your LLC, get your EIN, and assign a U.S. representative to support the TikTok Shop requirements.</p><a class="card-link" href="/services">See registration →</a></article>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>
<section class="media-section" id="about-us">
 <div class="container split media-split">
  <figure class="media-frame reveal">
   <img src="/images/dev-with-c-1.webp" width="1000" height="562" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="low" alt="TikTok website shown with a United States flag, representing TikTok Shop USA market access">
  </figure>
  <div class="reveal">
   <span class="section-kicker">Cross-border launch</span>
   <h2>Launch Your U.S. TikTok Shop — No U.S. Documents Needed</h2>
   <p class="lead">We help international creators and brands build the U.S. setup required to launch on TikTok Shop USA — without relocating your team or piecing the process together yourself.</p>
   <div class="mission-grid">
    <div class="mini-panel"><span>Mission</span><strong>Make the U.S. launch process simple.</strong></div>
    <div class="mini-panel"><span>Focus</span><strong>Setup, representation, and approval support.</strong></div>
   </div>
   <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Start your U.S. setup</a></div>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>
<section class="surface-alt">
 <div class="container">
  <div class="section-head reveal"><div><span class="section-kicker">The process</span><h2>Our Seamless Process to Launch Your TikTok Shop USA</h2><p class="lead">We handle everything from company formation to final TikTok Shop approval, so you can focus on selling.</p></div></div>
  <div class="process">
   <article class="card step reveal"><span class="step-num">01</span><h3>U.S. LLC Formation</h3><p class="muted">We create your U.S. company in days.</p><p><b>✓</b> Entity setup</p></article>
   <article class="card step reveal"><span class="step-num">02</span><h3>EIN & Banking</h3><p class="muted">We get your EIN and assist with your bank setup.</p><p><b>✓</b> Payout readiness</p></article>
   <article class="card step reveal"><span class="step-num">03</span><h3>U.S. Representative</h3><p class="muted">We provide a compliant U.S. business rep.</p><p><b>✓</b> Local requirement support</p></article>
   <article class="card step reveal"><span class="step-num">04</span><h3>TikTok Shop Approval</h3><p class="muted">We handle submission and approval support.</p><p><b>✓</b> Platform launch</p></article>
  </div>
  <div class="actions reveal"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Talk to us about your launch</a></div>
 </div>
</section>
<section class="media-section">
 <div class="container split media-split media-reverse">
  <div class="reveal"><span class="section-kicker">Why LaunchLegit</span><h2>U.S. market access without building the backend yourself.</h2><p class="lead">We coordinate the setup layers that matter to international sellers — entity formation, EIN, banking assistance, U.S. representation, and TikTok Shop approval support.</p><ul class="check-list benefit-list"><li><b>✓</b> Built for international sellers</li><li><b>✓</b> Creator and brand launch workflows</li><li><b>✓</b> One coordinated setup process</li></ul><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/features">Explore features</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/case-studies">View case studies</a></div></div>
  <figure class="media-frame reveal">
   <img src="/images/dev-with-c.webp" width="1000" height="562" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="low" alt="TikTok Shop displayed on a smartphone, representing selling through TikTok Shop USA">
  </figure>
 </div>
</section>
<section class="eu-close" id="features">
 <div class="container split">
  <div class="reveal"><span class="section-kicker">For Europe & the UK</span><h2>Built for founders operating across borders.</h2></div>
  <div class="reveal"><p class="lead">If you're based in the UK, France, Germany, Benelux, the Nordics or elsewhere in Western Europe, our approach is designed around cross-border workflows, GDPR-conscious communication and time-zone-friendly coordination. We keep the U.S. setup separate from your existing market obligations and avoid assuming you operate like a U.S. business.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Discuss your market entry</a></div>
 </div>
</section>

<CalendlyWidget />
</Layout>
